  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In the 1950s, metallic spheres flying in formation were reported, according to the book The Report on Unidentified Flying Objects, published in 1956 by Edward J. Ruppelt, the Air Force captain who was first director of Blue Book, the US Air Force's UFO study of the 1950s and 60s. A writer named Marik von Rennenkampff points listeners to the book, saying \"if you read\" Ruppelt you will find such cases. He raises it to show that the Air Force's own investigator recorded reports that are hard to explain away."
